{"id":"steam-745540","steam":745540,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"EcoQuest: Explore, Discover, Protect!","summary":"“Eco Quest: Explore, Discover, Protect!” thrusts players into the role of Kai, a spirited environmental crusader on a mission to reshape the world’s perspective on water and climate.","about":"Experience an unparalleled eco-adventure in \"Eco Quest: Explore, Discover, Protect!\" Put yourself in the shoes of Kai, an ardent environmentalist hell-bent on changing the way people around the globe think about water and the environment.\r\n\r\nKai faces obstacles, mysteries, and encounters reflecting real-life problems on his trip through a world of wastefulness and disregard for environmental concerns. Kai embarks on a mission to ignite a flame of reform by revolutionising communities' detrimental traditions, armed with information, invention, and unrelenting drive.\r\n\r\nThis is more than just a game; it's a call to arms, a chance to join Kai on a mission where your small contribution goes a big way towards creating a better, more sustainable world. In \"Eco Quest: Explore, Discover, Protect!,\" your actions have a significant impact.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/745540/library_600x900.jpg?t=1712842003","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/745540/header.jpg?t=1712842003","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/745540/library_hero.jpg?t=1712842003","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/745540/header.jpg?t=1712842003","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/745540/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1712842003","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/745540/ss_3370dbd42ebc3a9aab8941380951d9713d861ed1.600x338.jpg?t=1712842003","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/74